<section id="A4.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.2 </span>Detailed Results for Functionality</h3>

<div id="A4.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We present the detailed results for functionality on both benchmarks in Tables <a href="#A4.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ D.2 Detailed Results for Functionality ‣ Appendix D Experiments ‣ Vibe Checker: Aligning Code Evaluationwith Human Preference" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> and <a href="#A4.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ D.2 Detailed Results for Functionality ‣ Appendix D Experiments ‣ Vibe Checker: Aligning Code Evaluationwith Human Preference" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>.</p>
</div>
