<section id="A4.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.3 </span>Detailed Results for Instruction Following</h3>

<div id="A4.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The detailed results for instruction-level and task-level IF scores on both benchmarks are provided in Tables <a href="#A4.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ D.3 Detailed Results for Instruction Following ‣ Appendix D Experiments ‣ Vibe Checker: Aligning Code Evaluationwith Human Preference" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>,  <a href="#A4.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ D.3 Detailed Results for Instruction Following ‣ Appendix D Experiments ‣ Vibe Checker: Aligning Code Evaluationwith Human Preference" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>,  <a href="#A4.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ D.3 Detailed Results for Instruction Following ‣ Appendix D Experiments ‣ Vibe Checker: Aligning Code Evaluationwith Human Preference" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>, and <a href="#A4.T10" title="Table 10 ‣ D.3 Detailed Results for Instruction Following ‣ Appendix D Experiments ‣ Vibe Checker: Aligning Code Evaluationwith Human Preference" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>.</p>
</div>
